(7369117, 1155910, 43191, '<td valign="top">I would suggest maybe cropping this a little tighter as there are so many reflections that compete for my attention. The point where the tip of the feather breaks the water makes for a lovely detail, I''d like to hone in on it.</td>', 'I would suggest maybe cropping this a little tighter as there are so many reflections that compete for my attention. The point where the tip of the feather breaks the water makes for a lovely detail, I''d like to hone in on it.', '2015-06-22 03:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
