(7369286, 1155454, 180155, '<td valign="top">I like the feeling of freedom the pic gives. Good composition.</td>', 'I like the feeling of freedom the pic gives. Good composition.', '2015-06-22 08:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369288, 1154703, 180155, '<td valign="top">I like the wit. Well executed composition.</td>', 'I like the wit. Well executed composition.', '2015-06-22 08:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369291, 1155598, 180155, '<td valign="top">I cannot quite pin it why but it is one of my favorite pics. There is some kind of energy in it.</td>', 'I cannot quite pin it why but it is one of my favorite pics. There is some kind of energy in it.', '2015-06-22 08:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369322, 1155311, 129807, '<td valign="top">I love that you have imbued the lifeless wood with emotion and feeling with your composition. Well done.</td>', 'I love that you have imbued the lifeless wood with emotion and feeling with your composition. Well done.', '2015-06-22 09:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369323, 1155897, 129807, '<td valign="top">Serendipity or set up? Either way, effective.</td>', 'Serendipity or set up? Either way, effective.', '2015-06-22 09:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369325, 1155970, 129807, '<td valign="top">It''s all about the lines. Those tiny imperfections draw the attention and invite you to look around (I couldn''t have helped myself, I would have cloned out the brighter ones!)</td>', 'It''s all about the lines. Those tiny imperfections draw the attention and invite you to look around (I couldn''t have helped myself, I would have cloned out the brighter ones!)', '2015-06-22 09:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369329, 1155792, 129807, '<td valign="top">I try to let the image speak to me before I read titles - I''d just worked this one out before my eye glanced down. It was the glitzy ribbon-y bits that gave it away. The play of light is interesting but the lighter edge on the right is slightly awkward.</td>', 'I try to let the image speak to me before I read titles - I''d just worked this one out before my eye glanced down. It was the glitzy ribbon-y bits that gave it away. The play of light is interesting but the lighter edge on the right is slightly awkward.', '2015-06-22 09:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369331, 1155926, 129807, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting. The reflection of the downy bit is a little confusing for me.</td>', 'Lovely lighting. The reflection of the downy bit is a little confusing for me.', '2015-06-22 09:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369335, 1154865, 129807, '<td valign="top">Images of this type are usually ''clean'' and so sharp you could cut yourself on them. You''ve taken a done-to-death image and put your own slant on it; it''s an interesting take. There is a blue halo on the right on both the feather and the reflection.</td>', 'Images of this type are usually ''clean'' and so sharp you could cut yourself on them. You''ve taken a done-to-death image and put your own slant on it; it''s an interesting take. There is a blue halo on the right on both the feather and the reflection.', '2015-06-22 09:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369339, 1155940, 129807, '<td valign="top">Cute wings. The pose is not quite right for me; I''m not quite sure if she''s kneeling or just sitting in the grass, as the feet are difficult to see in that lush lawn and her hands are positioned by her sides.</td>', 'Cute wings. The pose is not quite right for me; I''m not quite sure if she''s kneeling or just sitting in the grass, as the feet are difficult to see in that lush lawn and her hands are positioned by her sides.', '2015-06-22 09:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369346, 1155469, 129807, '<td valign="top">Very busy image - very busy feathers! - damned ugly head. This image might have appealed to me more if the feathers were a full frame crop.</td>', 'Very busy image - very busy feathers! - damned ugly head. This image might have appealed to me more if the feathers were a full frame crop.', '2015-06-22 09:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369349, 1155900, 129807, '<td valign="top">They almost look like waving plant leaves. You have some definite processing problems at the top; looks like you''ve been darkening the background and it''s gone awry.</td>', 'They almost look like waving plant leaves. You have some definite processing problems at the top; looks like you''ve been darkening the background and it''s gone awry.', '2015-06-22 10:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369353, 1155879, 129807, '<td valign="top">I like to think I''m reasonably open minded about challenge interpretations; this is a stretch even for me. Although there are feathers in there, they are hardly the focal point. And you know it. Kudos.</td>', 'I like to think I''m reasonably open minded about challenge interpretations; this is a stretch even for me. Although there are feathers in there, they are hardly the focal point. And you know it. Kudos.', '2015-06-22 10:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369362, 1155427, 129807, '<td valign="top">Tack sharp, wonderful portrait of this creature, yet oddly clinical. Absolutely perfect for a birding manual.</td>', 'Tack sharp, wonderful portrait of this creature, yet oddly clinical. Absolutely perfect for a birding manual.', '2015-06-22 10:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369366, 1155529, 129807, '<td valign="top">This is a good capture. She/he looks almost startled. You have darkened the background and it has caused some obvious issues throughout its crown and around the beak and front of the neck.</td>', 'This is a good capture. She/he looks almost startled. You have darkened the background and it has caused some obvious issues throughout its crown and around the beak and front of the neck.', '2015-06-22 10:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369369, 1155517, 129807, '<td valign="top">Delightful! Nice set up; well done cat wrangling and then capturing that satisfied slurp.</td>', 'Delightful! Nice set up; well done cat wrangling and then capturing that satisfied slurp.', '2015-06-22 10:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369370, 1155161, 129807, '<td valign="top">Wonderful feather detail here. You''ve introduced a lot of noise to get that detail though.</td>', 'Wonderful feather detail here. You''ve introduced a lot of noise to get that detail though.', '2015-06-22 10:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369375, 1155163, 129807, '<td valign="top">Obviously you can''t control this situation, but I don''t like that the wing is cut off and it seems a bit glowy. Good shot though!</td>', 'Obviously you can''t control this situation, but I don''t like that the wing is cut off and it seems a bit glowy. Good shot though!', '2015-06-22 10:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369376, 1154617, 129807, '<td valign="top">Great capture. There are sharpening halo''s by the look of it.</td>', 'Great capture. There are sharpening halo''s by the look of it.', '2015-06-22 10:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369378, 1155871, 129807, '<td valign="top">This looks so much like a Dudski. Lovely.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-07-08 04:42:43.</i></td>', 'This looks so much like a Dudski. Lovely.', '2015-06-22 10:34:37.000000', '2015-07-08 05:42:43.000000', 1),
(7369387, 1155328, 129807, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and lovely image treatment. You''ve purposefully chosen the crop and I respect that, but my preference would have been for more off the <strike>left</strike> right to turn it into a traditional portrait composition. But perhaps I''m boring like that.<br/> <br/>eta: my other left, that is.</td>', 'Nice capture and lovely image treatment. You''ve purposefully chosen the crop and I respect that, but my preference would have been for more off the left right to turn it into a traditional portrait composition. But perhaps I''m boring like that. eta: my other left, that is.', '2015-06-22 10:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369413, 1155781, 43191, '<td valign="top">lovely scene. The light coming through those wings is divine.</td>', 'lovely scene. The light coming through those wings is divine.', '2015-06-22 11:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
