(7369693, 1155716, 67258, '<td valign="top">Love the tongue sticking out.  Super pop against the background, but I do wish that there was a catchlight in the eye and that the textural detail of the feathers was clearer.  Nonetheless, a good entry.</td>', 'Love the tongue sticking out.  Super pop against the background, but I do wish that there was a catchlight in the eye and that the textural detail of the feathers was clearer.  Nonetheless, a good entry.', '2015-06-22 16:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
