(7369702, 1154969, 67258, '<td valign="top">Interesting feather detail and good exposure.  On a picky note, I wish the white patch in the top right hand corner wasn''t there; the frame is a little tight and restrictive.</td>', 'Interesting feather detail and good exposure.  On a picky note, I wish the white patch in the top right hand corner wasn''t there; the frame is a little tight and restrictive.', '2015-06-22 16:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
