(7369873, 1155652, 30454, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting here, excellent choice of white background.  I like the soft focus here.</td>', 'I really like the lighting here, excellent choice of white background.  I like the soft focus here.', '2015-06-22 19:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
