(7369878, 1155458, 30454, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus and lighting.  Is it jus my monitor or photo is too sharp?</td>', 'Excellent focus and lighting.  Is it jus my monitor or photo is too sharp?', '2015-06-22 19:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369879, 1155951, 30454, '<td valign="top">Excellent macro, great lighting and colors.</td>', 'Excellent macro, great lighting and colors.', '2015-06-22 19:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369880, 1154990, 30454, '<td valign="top">Excellent control over lighting.  Nice portrait.</td>', 'Excellent control over lighting.  Nice portrait.', '2015-06-22 19:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369881, 1155548, 30454, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors, skin tone. Nice moment captured.</td>', 'Excellent colors, skin tone. Nice moment captured.', '2015-06-22 19:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369885, 1155764, 30454, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting,  good luck.</td>', 'Excellent lighting,  good luck.', '2015-06-22 19:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7370002, 1155311, 62249, '<td valign="top">Good concept. Decent lighting. Wish it had just a bit more DOF to avoid the softness of the left hand.</td>', 'Good concept. Decent lighting. Wish it had just a bit more DOF to avoid the softness of the left hand.', '2015-06-22 22:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7370004, 1155883, 62249, '<td valign="top">Super cute. Odd looking wings on left chick.</td>', 'Super cute. Odd looking wings on left chick.', '2015-06-22 22:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7370005, 1154865, 62249, '<td valign="top">Composition is good. Image is over processed, especially along the edge of the V-shaped white space on right of the image. See the funky colored (blue, green) halos there? The image also has a lot of unflattering noise that isn''t helping, and keep an eye out for spots and specks that can be touched up.</td>', 'Composition is good. Image is over processed, especially along the edge of the V-shaped white space on right of the image. See the funky colored (blue, green) halos there? The image also has a lot of unflattering noise that isn''t helping, and keep an eye out for spots and specks that can be touched up.', '2015-06-22 22:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7370008, 1155717, 62249, '<td valign="top">Humorous concept. My spouse thought this would be even funnier if you''d put some kind of head on the bird, such as a woody or a rubber duckie head. Lighting needs work. It looks pretty flat on the front of the bird and yet is casting a harsh shadow behind the bird.</td>', 'Humorous concept. My spouse thought this would be even funnier if you''d put some kind of head on the bird, such as a woody or a rubber duckie head. Lighting needs work. It looks pretty flat on the front of the bird and yet is casting a harsh shadow behind the bird.', '2015-06-22 22:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7370010, 1155946, 62249, '<td valign="top">The central part of the image is interesting with the mix of sharp and blurry feather skeins. The upper left and lower right corner have visible bits of extra stuff that should''ve been cleaned up.</td>', 'The central part of the image is interesting with the mix of sharp and blurry feather skeins. The upper left and lower right corner have visible bits of extra stuff that should''ve been cleaned up.', '2015-06-22 22:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7370011, 1155873, 62249, '<td valign="top">Interesting looking background. Bird isn''t in sharp focus, but bird pose is cute.</td>', 'Interesting looking background. Bird isn''t in sharp focus, but bird pose is cute.', '2015-06-22 22:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7370013, 1154994, 62249, '<td valign="top">File under Jobs That Get Old Quickly :-). Points for doing something out of the box. And the punny title.</td>', 'File under Jobs That Get Old Quickly :-). Points for doing something out of the box. And the punny title.', '2015-06-22 22:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7370015, 1155963, 62249, '<td valign="top">Interesting looking bird. Like that the eyes are pretty sharp and the eye on the viewer''s right has a catchlight. The branches are WAY over processed, resulting in ugly halos.</td>', 'Interesting looking bird. Like that the eyes are pretty sharp and the eye on the viewer''s right has a catchlight. The branches are WAY over processed, resulting in ugly halos.', '2015-06-22 22:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7370019, 1155179, 62249, '<td valign="top">A nice take on the challenge. Would like a bit more light from the left to highlight more of the model''s musculature.</td>', 'A nice take on the challenge. Would like a bit more light from the left to highlight more of the model''s musculature.', '2015-06-22 22:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7370020, 1155450, 62249, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit. Ideally I''d like a wrinkle-free background, but this isn''t bad. Background has some spots that need touching up.</td>', 'Nicely lit. Ideally I''d like a wrinkle-free background, but this isn''t bad. Background has some spots that need touching up.', '2015-06-22 22:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7370021, 1155598, 62249, '<td valign="top">Good idea to contrast soft feathers with sharp thorns. The lighting and composition could be improved. And light areas to the upper left of the feather (out of focus thorns, I assume) are distracting.</td>', 'Good idea to contrast soft feathers with sharp thorns. The lighting and composition could be improved. And light areas to the upper left of the feather (out of focus thorns, I assume) are distracting.', '2015-06-22 22:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7370024, 1155529, 62249, '<td valign="top">Interesting bird, and I like it against the black background. Processing of black areas between the feathers isn''t as successful. Those areas look greenish and have nots in them.</td>', 'Interesting bird, and I like it against the black background. Processing of black areas between the feathers isn''t as successful. Those areas look greenish and have nots in them.', '2015-06-22 22:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7370114, 1155912, 115814, '<td valign="top">I''m enjoying being part of the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1296711" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">DPL "First 10" Challenge</a>. Yours is photo #1 in my random voting stream. <br/> <br/>I like the abstract nature of this image. The diagonal line creates a sense of balance that works well with the contrasting area of light and dark. I''d be curious about the effect of a bit more DOF, although this choice effectively puts the center of attention right in the center of the frame.</td>', 'I''m enjoying being part of the DPL "First 10" Challenge. Yours is photo #1 in my random voting stream.  I like the abstract nature of this image. The diagonal line creates a sense of balance that works well with the contrasting area of light and dark. I''d be curious about the effect of a bit more DOF, although this choice effectively puts the center of attention right in the center of the frame.', '2015-06-23 00:49:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7370115, 1155893, 115814, '<td valign="top">I''m enjoying being part of the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1296711" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">DPL "First 10" Challenge</a>. Yours is photo #3 in my random voting stream. <br/> <br/>This has lovely soft and gentle aura to it. The toning and exposure choices accentuate the subject really well and the pattern/placement of the feathers creates interesting combined symmetry and asymmetry. However, brightness in the very center tends to hold my attention at a less than interesting point, and the shadow at the upper left seems a bit out of character. Overall quite engaging work!</td>', 'I''m enjoying being part of the DPL "First 10" Challenge. Yours is photo #3 in my random voting stream.  This has lovely soft and gentle aura to it. The toning and exposure choices accentuate the subject really well and the pattern/placement of the feathers creates interesting combined symmetry and asymmetry. However, brightness in the very center tends to hold my attention at a less than interesting point, and the shadow at the upper left seems a bit out of character. Overall quite engaging work!', '2015-06-23 00:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7370116, 1155495, 115814, '<td valign="top">I''m enjoying being part of the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1296711" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">DPL "First 10" Challenge</a>. Yours is photo #5 in my random voting stream. <br/> <br/>Definitely evocative of the Sonoran Desert and American Indian and frontier traditions. I like the toning choices and the implication of age. Not sure the border adds anything. Nice!</td>', 'I''m enjoying being part of the DPL "First 10" Challenge. Yours is photo #5 in my random voting stream.  Definitely evocative of the Sonoran Desert and American Indian and frontier traditions. I like the toning choices and the implication of age. Not sure the border adds anything. Nice!', '2015-06-23 00:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7370119, 1154865, 115814, '<td valign="top">I''m enjoying being part of the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1296711" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">DPL "First 10" Challenge</a>. Yours is photo #2 in my random voting stream. <br/> <br/>The placement of feather in the top third of the frame works nicely to give room for the full reflection and the amount of negative space white is right on. I''m distracted by the turquoise and blue color fringing and wish the whole thing was a bit sharper and not so grainy.</td>', 'I''m enjoying being part of the DPL "First 10" Challenge. Yours is photo #2 in my random voting stream.  The placement of feather in the top third of the frame works nicely to give room for the full reflection and the amount of negative space white is right on. I''m distracted by the turquoise and blue color fringing and wish the whole thing was a bit sharper and not so grainy.', '2015-06-23 00:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7370120, 1155372, 115814, '<td valign="top">I''m enjoying being part of the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1296711" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">DPL "First 10" Challenge</a>. Yours is photo #4 in my random voting stream. <br/> <br/>Wow. It''s blue. It''s feathers, it''s pastel. Might even be graveyard, depending on the condition of the feather donor. Seriously, and interesting feather abstract with interesting textures and lighting variation. Nice.</td>', 'I''m enjoying being part of the DPL "First 10" Challenge. Yours is photo #4 in my random voting stream.  Wow. It''s blue. It''s feathers, it''s pastel. Might even be graveyard, depending on the condition of the feather donor. Seriously, and interesting feather abstract with interesting textures and lighting variation. Nice.', '2015-06-23 00:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7370121, 1155575, 115814, '<td valign="top">I''m enjoying being part of the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1296711" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">DPL "First 10" Challenge</a>. Yours is photo #6 in my random voting stream. <br/> <br/>I read Umberto Eco many years ago. You''ve quoted the last line of the book and filled your photo with further mystery. Exceptionally processed and appropriately feathered. Kudos.</td>', 'I''m enjoying being part of the DPL "First 10" Challenge. Yours is photo #6 in my random voting stream.  I read Umberto Eco many years ago. You''ve quoted the last line of the book and filled your photo with further mystery. Exceptionally processed and appropriately feathered. Kudos.', '2015-06-23 00:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7370133, 1155648, 115814, '<td valign="top">I''m enjoying being part of the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1296711" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">DPL "First 10" Challenge</a>. Yours is photo #8 in my random voting stream. <br/> <br/>I''m not sure what to think of this. It seems to be stuck between abstract and representational. Interesting lines and arcs, and an attention grabbing band of sharp focus that catches the rachis nicely along its path. Add a bit of mystery from the left frame and a couple of handful of sensor dust spot, and you''ve got this enigma of a photo. Did I mention I''m not sure what t think of this?</td>', 'I''m enjoying being part of the DPL "First 10" Challenge. Yours is photo #8 in my random voting stream.  I''m not sure what to think of this. It seems to be stuck between abstract and representational. Interesting lines and arcs, and an attention grabbing band of sharp focus that catches the rachis nicely along its path. Add a bit of mystery from the left frame and a couple of handful of sensor dust spot, and you''ve got this enigma of a photo. Did I mention I''m not sure what t think of this?', '2015-06-23 01:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7370134, 1155017, 115814, '<td valign="top">I''m enjoying being part of the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1296711" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">DPL "First 10" Challenge</a>. Yours is photo #9 in my random voting stream. <br/> <br/>Nicely set off from the BG. An interesting position - not sure I''ve seen this tableau with tail feathers and wings in action on a hummingbird. That said, it''s likely because I don''t take much time with them... not a big fan, but this certainly shows off hummingbird feather in a cool way.</td>', 'I''m enjoying being part of the DPL "First 10" Challenge. Yours is photo #9 in my random voting stream.  Nicely set off from the BG. An interesting position - not sure I''ve seen this tableau with tail feathers and wings in action on a hummingbird. That said, it''s likely because I don''t take much time with them... not a big fan, but this certainly shows off hummingbird feather in a cool way.', '2015-06-23 01:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
