(7370965, 1155328, 3936, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  This would be so much less with the distractions of color.  Wonderful lighting, exposure, and tack sharp.  This should be hanging in a gallery.</td>', 'Beautiful!  This would be so much less with the distractions of color.  Wonderful lighting, exposure, and tack sharp.  This should be hanging in a gallery.', '2015-06-23 23:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
