(7371543, 1155914, 138253, '<td valign="top">it''s truly a pleasant experience to see your self portraits in a challenge. I''ve always been thoroughly impressed with your ability to create such fantastic images that are so very different, yet fundamentally the same. Kudos to you my friend, great work as always.<br/>8</td>', 'it''s truly a pleasant experience to see your self portraits in a challenge. I''ve always been thoroughly impressed with your ability to create such fantastic images that are so very different, yet fundamentally the same. Kudos to you my friend, great work as always.8', '2015-06-24 09:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
