(7371592, 1155822, 138253, '<td valign="top">i get that birds come from eggs so there is a correlation there, but the egg seems to be more the central subject than the feather, in a challenge about feathers. every time i look at this, my eye is drawn to the egg and the feather blends into the background too much.<br/>while i can understand a "light and fluffy" feather entry being soft, it feels rather "out of focus" here given the theme.<br/> <br/>**Edit**<br/>After a full and complete pass of the full-size images, this is getting a bump in score. I still feel that my eye is drawn to the egg and that the feather is rather on the soft side for my personal preference, but it''s still a better shot than many other entries in the challenge.</td>', 'i get that birds come from eggs so there is a correlation there, but the egg seems to be more the central subject than the feather, in a challenge about feathers. every time i look at this, my eye is drawn to the egg and the feather blends into the background too much.while i can understand a "light and fluffy" feather entry being soft, it feels rather "out of focus" here given the theme. **Edit**After a full and complete pass of the full-size images, this is getting a bump in score. I still feel that my eye is drawn to the egg and that the feather is rather on the soft side for my personal preference, but it''s still a better shot than many other entries in the challenge.', '2015-06-24 10:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
