(7372479, 1155285, 180696, '<td valign="top">A bird... Hardly enough depth of field and not making much of a statement in terms of the theme "Feathers". A very busy foreground. The general rule of photography means that when taking photos of any animal or being, the eyes, if seen, should be as pin-sharp as possible.</td>', 'A bird... Hardly enough depth of field and not making much of a statement in terms of the theme "Feathers". A very busy foreground. The general rule of photography means that when taking photos of any animal or being, the eyes, if seen, should be as pin-sharp as possible.', '2015-06-25 09:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
