(7374123, 1155773, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice image, well lit and lovely DOF.  Love that the one foot looks like it''s just leaving the post.</td>', 'Nice image, well lit and lovely DOF.  Love that the one foot looks like it''s just leaving the post.', '2015-06-27 11:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
