(7374639, 1155883, 97225, '<td valign="top">Just love this. I thought as soon as I saw it it would be my top pick. It is. 10</td>', 'Just love this. I thought as soon as I saw it it would be my top pick. It is. 10', '2015-06-28 02:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
