(7375589, 1155532, 83149, '<td valign="top">This is just gorgeous, and I expect to see this ribbon.  The colours are vibrant and there is just the right amount of detail.  My one small complaint is what appears as an orange glow in the upper right, and somewhat to the right of the beak.  I believe they are just OOF elements behind but that doesn''t change the way it looks.  Still, overall it is a fantastic shot.  Bravo!</td>', 'This is just gorgeous, and I expect to see this ribbon.  The colours are vibrant and there is just the right amount of detail.  My one small complaint is what appears as an orange glow in the upper right, and somewhat to the right of the beak.  I believe they are just OOF elements behind but that doesn''t change the way it looks.  Still, overall it is a fantastic shot.  Bravo!', '2015-06-29 00:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375591, 1155018, 83149, '<td valign="top">It''s a really good shot of a chicken, Very nice lighting and focus with good details in the feathers.  Unfortunately, it''s still a shot of a chicken.</td>', 'It''s a really good shot of a chicken, Very nice lighting and focus with good details in the feathers.  Unfortunately, it''s still a shot of a chicken.', '2015-06-29 00:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
