(7375594, 1155198, 83149, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice composition, but the focus is a little soft, which you really need for a macro like this.</td>', 'It''s a nice composition, but the focus is a little soft, which you really need for a macro like this.', '2015-06-29 00:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7375597, 1155940, 83149, '<td valign="top">Beautiful idea, but I wish there was a touch of contrast on the model. If this was a high key shot, the lighting would be great, but with the darker areas around the model, I think it would benefit from the added contrast.  It''s a beautiful set of wings, and pose though, and I expect this to do well.</td>', 'Beautiful idea, but I wish there was a touch of contrast on the model. If this was a high key shot, the lighting would be great, but with the darker areas around the model, I think it would benefit from the added contrast.  It''s a beautiful set of wings, and pose though, and I expect this to do well.', '2015-06-29 00:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
