(7375757, 1155694, 67697, '<td valign="top">I feel that this should have finished with a score above 6.  I like that the body of the bird is center focused.  The light and detail you captured is excellent.</td>', 'I feel that this should have finished with a score above 6.  I like that the body of the bird is center focused.  The light and detail you captured is excellent.', '2015-06-29 01:12:29.000000', NULL, 0),
