(7375762, 1155517, 113411, '<td valign="top">O Wow! This is so fabulous! Thank you for  your wonderful comments and votes.<br/>It is thrilling to have a 1st place especially during TPL with such incredible competition.<br/> <br/>My cat is addicted to "Temptations" chicken flavored treats. When the camera comes out, her tail goes up<br/>and she follows me around waiting to be filmed. I sprinkled some treats next to the feathers and had to stop shooting<br/>to pull the feathers out of her mouth. I did not realize that I had used guinea hen feathers, so of course it tasted like chicken.<br/> <br/>Thanks again guys and Go Hit Squad!</td>', 'O Wow! This is so fabulous! Thank you for  your wonderful comments and votes.It is thrilling to have a 1st place especially during TPL with such incredible competition. My cat is addicted to "Temptations" chicken flavored treats. When the camera comes out, her tail goes upand she follows me around waiting to be filmed. I sprinkled some treats next to the feathers and had to stop shootingto pull the feathers out of her mouth. I did not realize that I had used guinea hen feathers, so of course it tasted like chicken. Thanks again guys and Go Hit Squad!', '2015-06-29 01:14:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7375766, 1154703, 96574, '<td valign="top">Fantastic finish Rob!  I''m wondering if the ribbon was worth the wrath of the wife?  I think yes! :)<br/> <br/>GO HIT SQUAD!</td>', 'Fantastic finish Rob!  I''m wondering if the ribbon was worth the wrath of the wife?  I think yes! :) GO HIT SQUAD!', '2015-06-29 01:15:01.000000', NULL, 0),
