(7376319, 1155773, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>Your shot did quite well in voting. Any day you score over 6 is a good day. I really like this shot. The DOF is great. The colors are good. Very nice bird. You have captured plenty of detail in the bird and the wooden fence post. Your crop is also good. Overall good shot. Happy shooting</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... Your shot did quite well in voting. Any day you score over 6 is a good day. I really like this shot. The DOF is great. The colors are good. Very nice bird. You have captured plenty of detail in the bird and the wooden fence post. Your crop is also good. Overall good shot. Happy shooting', '2015-06-29 12:34:19.000000', NULL, 0),
