(7378594, 1155951, 80831, '<td valign="top">I guess I can see the point of the commenters in that the drops pull your eyes away from the feathers but I still love the creativity in this shot.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I guess I can see the point of the commenters in that the drops pull your eyes away from the feathers but I still love the creativity in this shot.  Nicely done!', '2015-07-01 01:19:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7378739, 1155727, 35321, '<td valign="top">My top pick for the challenge (9).  Not sure how I would have improved on it, maybe try to get the right half as sharp as the left.  Though in retrospect, there''s an odd blurry triangular wedge on the right.  Sorry, I would have bumped you down a point or two if I had noticed that when I was voting (but I didn''t--yay!).  Yup, certainly some fishy stuff going on in the far right upper 2/3s.</td>', 'My top pick for the challenge (9).  Not sure how I would have improved on it, maybe try to get the right half as sharp as the left.  Though in retrospect, there''s an odd blurry triangular wedge on the right.  Sorry, I would have bumped you down a point or two if I had noticed that when I was voting (but I didn''t--yay!).  Yup, certainly some fishy stuff going on in the far right upper 2/3s.', '2015-07-01 02:43:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7378744, 1155018, 16106, '<td valign="top">The only thing wrong with this image is that it is of a chicken. The lighting is lovely, the colors are rich, the pose is perfect; But it is a chicken. Next to stuffed animals, few things are going to score worse on DPC than a chicken. Why we love seeing cows and sheep but hate looking at chickens is one of life''s enduring mysteries.</td>', 'The only thing wrong with this image is that it is of a chicken. The lighting is lovely, the colors are rich, the pose is perfect; But it is a chicken. Next to stuffed animals, few things are going to score worse on DPC than a chicken. Why we love seeing cows and sheep but hate looking at chickens is one of life''s enduring mysteries.', '2015-07-01 02:51:17.000000', NULL, 0),
