(7383612, 1155463, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>Your DOF is very nice on this. Perfect focus point for this type of shot. The details/textures are also quite nice. However I think it would have added interest to it if the pearl / bead was more off center. Happy shooting.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... Your DOF is very nice on this. Perfect focus point for this type of shot. The details/textures are also quite nice. However I think it would have added interest to it if the pearl / bead was more off center. Happy shooting.', '2015-07-07 17:55:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7385223, 1155897, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>1st of all I want to say I like it. The feather being off center is a good touch. The overall scenery is good. I like being able to see the rocks/pebbles at the bottom of the lake. Fairly clear water. I also like your DOF. The only thing that is just not doing it for me is the brightness of the shot. The sky is too bright and that bleeds down into the water. Good job. Happy shooting.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... 1st of all I want to say I like it. The feather being off center is a good touch. The overall scenery is good. I like being able to see the rocks/pebbles at the bottom of the lake. Fairly clear water. I also like your DOF. The only thing that is just not doing it for me is the brightness of the shot. The sky is too bright and that bleeds down into the water. Good job. Happy shooting.', '2015-07-10 10:03:04.000000', NULL, 0),
